# Knob-controlled servo
# Level 3 - Sensors and motors
#
# The servo follows the knob, like a steering wheel.
# You learn: scale() to turn one kind of value into another (percent into degrees).
# You need: a potentiometer on A0 and a small servo on pin 9 (red to 5V, brown to GND).

board uno
use mujard.servo

knob = analog A0
arm  = Servo(pin 9)

every 20 ms:
    var angle = scale(knob.percent, 0 %..100 %, 0 deg..180 deg)
    arm.move(angle)
